            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Damn, that's quite the essay for a problem with a highlight group that could lead to a possible PR fix consisting of a few lines.\r\n\r\nIn addition to all of that above, I'm thinking that maybe making the mini.base16 module somewhat more customizable would be better, because right now it's mostly just a list of 16 numbers and a couple boolean options.",
